age.", "[Intro - 0:00-0:04, short atmospheric female hum]\n屏幕亮了一夜\n字句冷得刺眼\n\n[Verse 1 - 0:04-0:18, gentle female vocal]\n头像藏在人群后\n轻轻敲下伤口\n一句玩笑太随手\n却让心跳发抖\n\n热搜翻过旧名字\n笑声没有尽头\n安静不是默认\n只是还没开口\n\n[Pre-Chorus - 0:18-0:30, building emotion]\n别把恶意当热闹\n别把冷眼当问候\n屏幕后的温柔\n也需要被看见\n\n[Chorus - 0:30-0:50, catchy hook, stronger vocal]\n别让沉默盖过我\n别让恶语困住我\n每个字落下之前\n先看见真实的我\n\n别让沉默盖过我\n别让人群淹没我\n温柔不是软弱\n勇敢会发声\n\n[Verse 2 - 0:50-1:04, emotional continuation]\n评论像一场冷雨\n落在深夜窗口\n有人躲在光背后\n把善良都偷走\n\n可仍有一束声音\n轻轻穿过风口\n说别害怕回头\n有人陪你往前走\n\n[Bridge - 1:04-1:16, intimate reduced instruments]\n不需要谁来审判\n不需要假装坚强\n把破碎的呼吸\n慢慢唱成方向\n\n[Final Chorus - 1:16-1:28, powerful memorable hook]\n别让沉默盖过我\n别让恶语困住我\n每个字落下之前\n先看见真实的我\n\n别让沉默盖过我\n别让人群淹没我\n温柔不是软弱\n勇敢会发声\n\n[Outro - 1:28-1:30, fading vocal]\n勇敢会发声", 0, "fixed", 82, 90, "4", "zh", "A minor", true, 2, 0.85, 0.9, 0, 0], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 261, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "tags"}, "name": "tags", "label": "tags", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "tags"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "link": 264, "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "bpm"}, "name": "bpm", "link": 266, "label": "bpm", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "bpm"}, {"widget": {"name": "duration"}, "name": "duration", "link": 267, "label": "duration", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "timesignature"}, "name": "timesignature", "label": "timesignature", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "timesignature"}, {"widget": {"name": "language"}, "name": "language", "label": "language", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "language"}, {"widget": {"name": "keyscale"}, "name": "keyscale", "label": "keyscale", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "keyscale"}, {"widget": {"name": "generate_audio_codes"}, "name": "generate_audio_codes", "label":